OL,3,GNEWSAMove to secure international
OL,4,Atennis in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of international tennis in
OL,7,FEastbourne has moved a step closer to
OL,8,Fbeing secured after councillors backed
OL,9,Ftalks on a new long-term lease with the
OL,10,FLawn Tennis Association (LTA).
OL,12,FEastbourne Borough Council (EBC) has
OL,13,Fendorsed discussions with the LTA on
OL,14,Fproposals that would see the governing
OL,15,Fbody take over the Devonshire quarter.
OL,17,FThe LTA and EBC also deliver the annual
OL,18,FEastbourne Open International Tennis
OL,19,FTournament, which attracts almost
OL,20,F50,000 spectators and generates a #5m
OL,21,Fboost to the local economy.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
