OL,3,GNEWSAMove to secure international
OL,4,Atennis in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Pollard, LTA managing director of
OL,7,Fcommercial and operations said they are
OL,8,F"excited" and "firmly committed" to
OL,9,Ftake on the lease.
